      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-24T12:44:37Z",
      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and call trace, the proxy creation receipt, the implementation bytecode, every Upgraded log from deployment through the exploit, the pinned technical reproduction, and the loss transfers. Transaction 0x834f9bf54e7ae31ac4d65af5a984c5b9e074b4fc8a30f8296a8dd4d129a3cdb4 created proxy 0xc6a8c02dd5a3dd1616ec072bfc7c9d3df9682a63 at block 40432001. A complete range scan found four pre-incident Upgraded logs: 0xa91dfcbd7f32739bdb541660db5abd6bb2d21013832e91b18fc9ffb216c419e5:148 selected 0x1202a2b90ccf80be7643d0f2bcedfca01cdf1c48 at block 40432353; 0x19b01a8e4709380e3200988339ac73770bd62e5468f9c246d901458f71d2e706:37 selected 0x5c153a1d3ef1fd37c2d1904aab661c0c4818b66c at block 40783711; 0x9249e41645c43b09407e85a7afa66193efe13d2ba2194c10db264884593b6e80:40 selected 0xeda9413cbb4e7bbcd445233991309470c32245d0 at block 41531305; and 0xb1ecf5569d739d5aebfba26b53d00edd95004f22bc7f1fa597fbcd7c96adc46b:78 selected the recorded artifact 0xa3f6af29001874ed06c1bf41427e33256b1d97d4 at block 41531421, which the exploit trace executes by delegatecall. The implementation's unauthenticated payable selector 0x5fc985ea executes caller-supplied swaps using contract funds. The receipt shows 11 WBNB borrowed and repaid to DODO and exactly 8.8 WBNB sent to the attacker EOA, establishing net loss."
